193	{"asin": "B07P8G2FTJ", "omdb": {"DVD": null, "Plot": "At the height of his stardom, the world's biggest pop star, Michael Jackson, began long-running relationships with two boys, aged seven and ten, and their families. They now allege that he sexually abused them.", "Type": "movie", "Year": "2019", "Genre": ["Documentary"], "Rated": "TV-MA", "Title": "Leaving Neverland", "Actors": ["Michael Jackson", "Wade Robson", "Joy Robson", "Chantal Robson"], "Awards": "Won 1 Primetime Emmy. Another 5 wins & 7 nominations.", "Poster": "https://m.media-amazon.com/images/M/MV5BYzZmNTBjOTctY2VjZi00MjA1LTgwYjktNmMwMzkwMjUwNmVhXkEyXkFqcGdeQXVyMzY0MTE3NzU@._V1_SX300.jpg", "Writer": null, "imdbID": "tt9573980", "Country": "UK, USA", "Ratings": [{"Value": "7.0/10", "Source": "Internet Movie Database"}], "Runtime": "240 min", "Website": null, "Director": ["Dan Reed"], "Language": "English", "Released": "08 Mar 2019", "Response": "True", "BoxOffice": null, "Metascore": null, "imdbVotes": "23,835", "Production": null, "imdbRating": "7.0", "statuscode": 200}, "comment": "<p>The first time I watched this, I had to take a break between the two parts because it is that heavy. If I set aside the young age, and if what MJ did to those boys (and likely others) did not include anal sex, I might be willing to give him a pass. Until I saw this documentary, I believed MJ to be innocent. Now I know better. Oprah said that hollywood no longer allows their people to shine so brightly that they can do no wrong. I certainly hope that is the case.</p>", "datewatched": "2019-dec-01", "watchmethod": "hbogo.com"}	2019-12-01 19:45:00.212551-05	1	\N	\N	268
