260	{"asin": "B000I8HIXQ", "omdb": {"DVD": "13 Jun 2006", "Plot": "When the coach of the France soccer team is killed by a poisoned dart in the stadium in the end of a game, and his expensive and huge ring with the diamond Pink Panther disappears, the ambitious Chief Insp. Dreyfus assigns the worst police inspector Jacques Clouseau to the case. His intention is to give a diversion to the press, while he uses his best men to chase the killer and thief. He assigns Gendarme Gilbert Ponton to work with Clouseau and inform each step of the investigation. When Clouseau is nominated with honor to the highest prize in France, Dreyfus decides to humiliate Clouseau and take him out of the case. However Clouseau has already solved the mystery.", "Type": "movie", "Year": "2006", "Genre": ["Adventure", "Comedy", "Crime", "Family", "Mystery"], "Rated": "PG", "Title": "The Pink Panther", "Actors": ["Steve Martin", "Kevin Kline", "Jean Reno", "Emily Mortimer"], "Awards": "1 win & 8 nominations.", "Poster": "https://m.media-amazon.com/images/M/MV5BNGI2MjVlNzEtZDg1ZS00MGU1LWFhNTQtNzMwZDViOWRkNzhkXkEyXkFqcGdeQXVyNTIzOTk5ODM@._V1_SX300.jpg", "Writer": ["Len Blum (screenplay)", "Steve Martin (screenplay)", "Len Blum (story)", "Michael Saltzman (story)", "Maurice Richlin (characters)", "Blake Edwards (characters)"], "imdbID": "tt0383216", "Country": ["USA", "Czech Republic"], "Ratings": [{"Value": "5.7/10", "Source": "Internet Movie Database"}, {"Value": "21%", "Source": "Rotten Tomatoes"}, {"Value": "38/100", "Source": "Metacritic"}], "Runtime": "93 min", "Website": null, "Director": ["Shawn Levy"], "Language": ["English"], "Released": "10 Feb 2006", "Response": "True", "BoxOffice": "$82,226,474", "Metascore": "38", "imdbVotes": "78,581", "Production": "MGM/Columbia", "imdbRating": "5.7", "statuscode": 200}, "comment": "<ul>\\r\\n<li>ridiculousness abounds</li>\\r\\n<li>steve martin</li>\\r\\n</ul>", "datewatched": "2020-apr-13 08:30pm edt", "watchmethod": "imdb.tv"}	2020-04-13 20:50:58