he bonds mature.\r\n                                                                                                                             \r\n[li] Q. Why are blonde jokes so short?[br]\r\n  A So men can remember them.\r\n                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                         [li] Q. How many men does it take to change a roll of toilet paper?[br]\r\nA. We don't know; it has never happened.\r\n                                                                                                                             \r\n                                                                                                                             [li] Q. Why is it difficult to find men who are sensitive, caring and good-looking?[br]\r\nA. They already have boyfriends.\r\n                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                          \r\n[li] Q. What do you call a woman who knows where her husband is every night?[br]\r\nA. A widow.\r\n                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                          \r\n[li] Q. Why are married women heavier than single women?[br]\r\nA. Single women come home, see what's in the fridge and go to bed. Married women come home, see what's in bed and go to the fridge.\r\n                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                       [li] Q. What is the one thing that all men at singles bars have in common?[br]\r\nA. They're married.\r\n                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                          \r\n[li] Man says to God: "God, why did you make woman so beautiful?" God says: "So you would love her." But God," the man says, "why did you make her so dumb?" God says: "So she would love you."\r\n                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                          [/ul]\r\n[bold]SEND THIS TO A SMART WOMAN WHO NEEDS A LAUGH AND TO THE GUYS YOU THINK CAN HANDLE IT![/bold]\r\n	2005-05-26 15:53:38.659101-04	2005-05-26 16:04:12.473011-04	1		\N	\N	PUBLIC
