26	73	1	Mouse Balls		[p]\r\nJuly 12, 1990\r\n[/p]\r\n[p]\r\nSubject: IBM BALL REPLACEMENT\r\n[/p]\r\n[p]\r\nAbstract:  Mouse Balls Available as FRU (Field Replacement Unit) \r\n[/p]\r\n[p]\r\nMouse balls are now available \r\nas FRU.  Therefore if a mouse fails to operate or should it perform \r\nerratically, it may need a ball replacement. \r\n[/p]\r\n[p]\r\nBecause of the delicate \r\nnature of this procedure, replacement of mouse balls should only be \r\nattempted by properly trained personnel.  Before proceeding, determine \r\nthe type of mouse balls by examining the underside of the mouse. \r\n[/p]\r\n[p]\r\nDomestic balls will be \r\nlarger and harder than foreign balls.  Ball removal procedures \r\ndiffer depending upon manufacturer of the mouse. Foreign balls can be \r\nreplaced using the pop-off method.  Domestic balls are replaced \r\nusing the twist off method. \r\n[/p]\r\n[p]\r\nMouse balls are not usually \r\nstatic sensitive; however, excessive handling can result in sudden discharge.  \r\nUpon completion of ball replacement, the mouse may be used immediately. \r\n[/p]\r\n[p]\r\nIt is recommended that \r\neach replacer have a pair of spare balls for maintaining optimum customer \r\nsatisfaction, and that any customer missing his balls should suspect \r\nlocal personnel of removing these necessary items. \r\n[/p]\r\n[p]\r\nTo re-order, specify one \r\nof the following:\r\n[/p]\r\n[p]\r\nP/N 33F6424 - Domestic Mouse Balls\r\n[/p]\r\n[p]\r\nP/N 33F8461 - Foreign Mouse Balls\r\n[/p]\r\n[p]\r\n \r\n[/p]\r\n[p]\r\n \r\n[/p]\r\n[p]\r\n[link:http://www.strangeplaces.net/weirdthings/mouseballs.html]original document[/link]\r\n[/p]\r\n[p]\r\n \r\n[/p]\r\n	2006-11-02 12:05:10.668192-05	2006-11-04 22:10:08.041067-05	1		\N	\N	PUBLIC
25	\N	1	cheater		<PoLaPaIn> how can i write a webapplictaion to dynamically generate a customized multiplication table?[br]\r\n<jonez> PoLaPaIn, carefully ;)[br]\r\n<PoLaPaIn> humm[br]\r\n<PoLaPaIn> jonez...trying to get it done for 3 days but donno what to do :([br]\r\n<PoLaPaIn> yape[br]\r\n<jonez> ask the teacher/prof/assistant[br]\r\n<PoLaPaIn> it's online class[br]\r\n<PoLaPaIn> and he said search in online[br]\r\n<jonez> "search online" does not mean "get someone on irc to give you the answer"[br]\r\n<PoLaPaIn> i searched in online[br]\r\n<PoLaPaIn> but didn't get any clue[br]\r\n<jonez> are you paying for this class?[br]\r\n<jonez> oh wait.. lemme guess.. this is due tomorrow, right?[br]\r\n<jonez> I am willing to help you with syntax errors, but I will not give you the solution.[br]\r\n<jonez> did this teacher give you any kind of example of what sort of result they want?[br]\r\n<PoLaPaIn> he just gave me an example[br]\r\n<PoLaPaIn> he made that one by himself and showed us the output[br]\r\n<PoLaPaIn> and told us you have to do it like this one[br]\r\n<PoLaPaIn> [link:http://164.58.125.200/WebApps/dynamicTables.aspx]http://164.58.125.200/WebApps/dynamicTables.aspx[/link][br]\r\n<PoLaPaIn> Here is the link[br]\r\n<PoLaPaIn> and he didn't say anything told us to search in online to get the multipication code[br]\r\n<jonez> so this teacher gave you permission to use whatever language you want on whatever platform you want?[br]\r\n<jonez> seems kind of unlikely.[br]\r\n<PoLaPaIn> yea[br]\r\n<p0windah> PoLaPaIn: looks tricky[br]\r\n<PoLaPaIn> it doesn't matter to him...as long as the work is done[br]\r\n<p0windah> PoLaPaIn: bleh, just write it in JS[br]\r\n<PoLaPaIn> Java don't have any idea about web developing software[br]\r\n<PoLaPaIn> took that class bcz i have to take a lower label class[br]\r\n<p0windah> PoLaPaIn: you're babbling[br]\r\n<PoLaPaIn> so took it[br]\r\n<PoLaPaIn> i donno.....[br]\r\n<p0windah> PoLaPaIn: anyway, its easy(in the extreme) and probably something you should figure out yourself - as your teacher hoped you would do[br]\r\n<jonez> PoLaPaIn, tell ya what.. give me a contact phone number for this teacher of yours, I'll get their permission and get back to you.[br]\r\n<PoLaPaIn> yea then hez gonna give me F[br]\r\n<PoLaPaIn> lolz[br]\r\n<jonez> right.. you are *cheating* if you ask here and somebody gives you the code and you turn it in as your own, and at *least* you deserve a failing grade.. in fact, if it was my class, I would have you expelled.[br]\r\n<jonez> have a nice day :)[br]\r\n<p0windah> jonez: you mean you wouldn't have him flayed in public ?[br]\r\n<p0windah> softcock..[br]\r\n<jonez> p0windah, I might, if only to set an example. but I would expel him first.[br]\r\n<p0windah> :P[br]\r\n<jonez> :)[br]\r\n[hr]\r\n[bold]update[/bold]: the cheater stayed in the channel, and claims that the following link [link:http://babbage.sosu.edu/~mmon/doll/final.php]mmon[/link] is his own work. at the moment I am planning to phone his university and complain about the guy.\r\n	2006-02-22 02:10:59.741242-05	2006-02-22 04:38:32.708287-05	1		\N	\N	PUBLIC
